# Strict allowlist. Vercel uploads ONLY what is re-included below; everything
# else in this repo — docs/ (operating agreement, EIN, financials), *.pdf /
# *.xlsx / *.csv / *.heic / *.zip, source, build tooling, and local archives —
# can never reach a Vercel build or deployment.
#
# NOTE: when the Node build system lands (Phase 2), `site/` becomes generated
# and this file is revised to allow the build inputs (src/, scripts/, api/,
# package.json) instead of the prebuilt site/.
*
!site
!site/**
